###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The RMSEs of MTP, SchNet and ANI on the bulk-water test sets E1 and E3-E7 (Fig. 1a) are a figure; the three bulk-water runs carry no metric. MTP level, cutoffs and the software used (the MLIP package and LAMMPS are the usual tools; PLUMED for metadynamics) were not captured.
# - Further systems (adsorbates on solvated Cu surfaces, binding and free energies from MLaMD-based metadynamics) each have their own on-the-fly potential; they are not encoded. Binding energies, RDFs and free-energy surfaces have no MetricProperty. Metadynamics is not a SimulationType individual.
# - The third water density of the T1 set and the sizes of the test sets are in Table S1 of the supplement.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

